// Track B (Power-Aware): annotation parsing + a budget that is respected
// Sample cost model assumed here: radioSend = 1.5mA, blinkLED = 0.3mA.
// Your team defines and documents its own cost table.
// Estimated draw: 1.5 + 0.3 = 1.8mA, which is within 2mA.
// Expected result (Subproject 2): accepted, prints:
//   sent
@power(2mA)
func transmitReading(value) {
    radioSend(value);
    blinkLED();
}

transmitReading(42);
print("sent");
